368
00:21:31,140 --> 00:21:32,200
say, handsome colleagues.

369
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,450
He starts to worry

370
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:34,830
and feels insecure every day,

371
00:21:34,830 --> 00:21:35,390
thinking that

372
00:21:35,390 --> 00:21:37,480
his girlfriend will cheat on him one day.

373
00:21:35,490 --> 00:21:37,310
[Would you ever cheat on someone someday?]

374
00:21:37,500 --> 00:21:39,540
As a result, he annoys the girl,

375
00:21:39,540 --> 00:21:41,620
and she actually breaks up with him.

376
00:21:41,670 --> 00:21:43,420
To me,

377
00:21:43,440 --> 00:21:45,870
I personally hate those

378
00:21:45,870 --> 00:21:47,830
